<title>USA: National Vision Q2 sales rise.</title>
<headline>National Vision Q2 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, Ga. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Vision Associates Ltd said on Tuesday its net sales for the second quarter ended June 28 were $44.5 million, up 10.0 percent over sales of $40.5 million for the comparable period a year ago.</p>
<p>For the first six months of the year, the company reported net sales of $88.9 million, up 10.0 percent over sales of $80.7 million last year.</p>
<p>National Vision provides eyecare products and services in department stores in the U.S. and abroad.</p>
</text>
